	(text "CAN termination (fixed)\nThis board is the rocket-side end of the CAN bus: R24 terminates\nit permanently, whether or not the umbilical is connected.\nThe GSE bus is split off by the Würth ICS CAN isolator in the GSE\nharness (see outer schematic). Umbilical + pigtail to the isolator\nis an unterminated stub: keep it short (<= 0.3 m at 1 Mbit/s).\nJ2.4 carries rocket GND to the isolator's GND2 (CAN reference)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9afcadba-8441-4b46-92e2-c18612a11955")
	)
