	(text "D1: ESD protection for the exposed J2 contacts. Place it right at J2\nwith a short, wide GND connection. 24 V standoff: the CAN lines must\nnever be able to reach a supply above 24 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 58.42 0)
		(effects
